OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain,
OL,6,Fsometimes heavy, will clear through
OL,7,FFriday morning, becoming brighter with
OL,8,Fscattered showers and strong winds.
OL,9,FThese showers continuing through
OL,10,FSaturday, but drier and brighter with
OL,11,Flighter winds on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
